title: random0
---
<<LifeSeen random0>>
<b>An Uneventful Day</b>: <br> There's a saying that no news is good news. You have come to appreciate it since the siege began. Today the guns are quiet. Men sleep beside their posts, shops open their shutters, and for a few hours the City remembers what an ordinary day felt like.
-> I will take a walk in the palace garden. One needs to appreciate the beauty around us even at times like this.
    The bells mark a quiet evening. On the walls and in the streets, people speak a little more easily.
    <<RndFraction fPeopleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fNobleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fPriestRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fTroopRep 0.01 0.03>>
-> I will catch up on sleep. My sleeping pattern has been horrible lately.
    The bells mark a quiet evening. On the walls and in the streets, people speak a little more easily.
    <<RndFraction fPeopleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fNobleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fPriestRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fTroopRep 0.01 0.03>>
-> I will read Marcus Aurelius' Meditations. It is a goldmine of great thoughts.
    The bells mark a quiet evening. On the walls and in the streets, people speak a little more easily.
    <<RndFraction fPeopleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fNobleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fPriestRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fTroopRep 0.01 0.03>>
-> I will go for a swim. I often forget that I live by the sea, I should make use of it more often.
    The bells mark a quiet evening. On the walls and in the streets, people speak a little more easily.
    <<RndFraction fPeopleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fNobleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fPriestRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fTroopRep 0.01 0.03>>
-> I will go talk to my friends about something other than war. Sometimes it is good to be together in silence.
    The bells mark a quiet evening. On the walls and in the streets, people speak a little more easily.
    <<RndFraction fPeopleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fNobleRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fPriestRep 0.01 0.03>>
    <<RndFraction fTroopRep 0.01 0.03>>
